@FKala.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5258



### Beispiel: Lade alle verfügbaren Measures
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Mgmt
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt LoadMeasures

### Get measure space usage (all measures)
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/StreamQuery
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt GETMEASURESPACE

### Get measure space usage (specific measures)
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/StreamQuery
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt GETMEASURESPACE measure1 measure2

### Get measure details (all measures)
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/StreamQuery
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt GETMEASUREDETAILS

### Delete a measure (WARNING: irreversible!)
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/StreamQuery
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt DELETEMEASURE measureName

### Truncate a measure (delete all data, keep structure)
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/StreamQuery
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt TRUNCATEMEASURE measureName

### Blacklist a measure
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/StreamQuery
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt BLACKLIST measureName

### Unblacklist a measure
POST {{FKala.Api_HostAddress}}/api/StreamQuery
Content-Type: text/plain

Mgmt UNBLACKLIST measureName
